# docs/img is generated by `mise run shots` but is committed: the README and
# docs/screens.md show it, and a reader has no build to make it from.

# Working notes, drafts and anything not meant for a reader of this repository.
.temp/

# The extension's signing key, and the signed archive it makes.
#
# There is no longer a key this repository could leak: the meter is signed on the
# machine it is installed on, by `packaging/omahouse-meter-pack` from
# `post_install`, with a key that lives at /etc/omahouse/meter/key.pem and dies
# with `pacman -R` -- docs/design.md §5.2, "The signing key, and why there is not
# one". These two lines stay anyway, because the failure they guard against is
# silent and the cost of keeping them is nothing: a key committed once is a key
# somebody else can sign a force-installed extension with, on every machine that
# has the policy.
*.pem
*.crx
